<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>uncared for</i>: esp. <i>unburied</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφρα μὲν Ἕκτωρ κεῖται ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.554
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ αὔτως κεῖται ἀ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.130
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώμοτ᾽ ἀκηδέα κεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.187
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.18
			</span></i>.Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>without care</i> or <i>sorrow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.526
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				489
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.42
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>carcless, heedless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δὲ γυναῖκες ἀκηδέες οὐ κομέουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.319
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.123
			</span></i>: c.gen., <i>taking no thought for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					208.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					913c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήδω</span>
			<i>harm harmless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.611
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.648
			</span></i>, cf. Epic. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
